# Personal CV evidence binder. Public site (.github.io) so most of this
# stays local — only papers/ (author's own SCI/KCI PDFs) and README are
# tracked. Patents, software registrations and degree certificates are
# excluded (contain personal IDs / KIMM internal numbers).
cv_documents/*
!cv_documents/papers/
!cv_documents/README.md
